{
  "$description": "Plenix · iOS size and behavior tokens (Plenix Platforms Standard 7.1): sizes in pt. The names are the web token names for the same role (plx-sys, plx-comp: the interaction sets) and the Plenix text roles (plx-text--<role>), so $extensions.plenix.web names the web token each value maps to; platformOnly marks a value the web has no role for. Plenix-owned values (color, type family, radius, focus) come from the theme files, never from here. Each value names its source (2.1) and level (2.2); Material Web tokens and Compose Material 3 defaults are recorded separately.",
